{"id":"7907c21bcd2a44be","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-computable-tight-k-bound.md","title":"A Computable Infinitely Often Tight K Bound","display":"thm-computable-tight-k-bound — A Computable Infinitely Often Tight K Bound","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-computable-tight-k-bound","aliases":["43-thm-computable-tight-k-bound"],"display":"thm-computable-tight-k-bound — A Computable Infinitely Often Tight K Bound","depends_on":["[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-pair-coding]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 6.8.1","source_printed_pages":"105","source_pdf_pages":"125","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-computable-tight-k-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-computable-tight-k-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-computable-tight-k-bound — A Computable Infinitely Often Tight K Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 6.8.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"105"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"125"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>；自然数参数按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}\\)</span> 编码。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a> 的部分可计算性；下式给出的函数类型同时要求在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 上总定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists g:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(g)\\land\\left(\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;K(\\sigma)\\le g(\\sigma)+c\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(|\\sigma|\\ge N\\land K(\\sigma)=g(\\sigma)\\right)\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists g:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(g)\\land\\left(\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;K(\\sigma)\\le g(\\sigma)+c\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(|\\sigma|\\ge N\\land K(\\sigma)=g(\\sigma)\\right)\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是存在某个非均匀选定的可计算上界；不能有效识别所有达到等号的位置，也不声称每个长度均有等号。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 6.8.1；印刷页 105，PDF 页 125。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pair-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]] 的部分可计算性；下式给出的函数类型同时要求在 $\\Sigma^*$ 上总定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists g:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(g)\\land\\left(\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;K(\\sigma)\\le g(\\sigma)+c\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(|\\sigma|\\ge N\\land K(\\sigma)=g(\\sigma)\\right)\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1683,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-computable-tight-k-bound]] — A Computable Infinitely Often Tight K Bound"}],"outgoing":["6cd902d852c2c848","f357216a7edb035a","e039afac1517f3d7"]}